[h1]Deep Space AI: Probably DeepSeek — Pawnshop Maid Assistant "Xiaojing"[/h1]
Looking for a helpful hand around your pawnshop? This mod introduces "Xiaojing", an interactive AI maid assistant (inspired by the DeepSeek mascot).
Chat with her naturally, and let her help you organize your pawnshop, sort your inventory, and check customer budgets and preferences!

[h2]💡 A Note on Early Development[/h2]
This mod is currently in [b]early active development[/b]. Xiaojing is still learning and growing, and more features and interactions will be added over time.
[b]If you have any suggestions, feature requests, or run into any bugs, please feel free to leave a comment below![/b]

[h2]✨ Key Features[/h2]
[list]
[*]💬 [b]Interactive Portrait & Natural Language Chat[/b]: Xiaojing stays on the left side of your shop (press [b]F6[/b] to toggle). Naturally breathes without floating feet. Click her portrait to chat freely.
[*]📦 [b]Hands to Organize Your Shop[/b]: Direct her in plain language (e.g., “Put all food from my bag onto the counter”, “Move scrap metal into the furnace input”). Supports inventory, nested folders, storage tabs, and machines while respecting game rules.
[*]👥 [b]Customer & Budget Inquiries[/b]: Ask about current visitor intent, remaining budget, refusal rules, and special barter/procurement/gunsmith orders; can also read recorder dialogue from the current visit.
[*]🔍 [b]Item Visual Inspection[/b]: After unlocking inspection, Xiaojing assists in reading visible details on mechanical hands, Ribwiches, Plasma Cartridges, cigarettes, food stamps, injectors, and water containers to detect defects and counterfeits (read-only; does not submit quotes).
[*]⚡ [b]Quick Replies & Arrival Alerts[/b]: Quick buttons for “Pick goods for customer” and “Appraise customer items”; whispers local notices when wanted or augmented visitors arrive (on-duty security staff excluded).
[*]📖 [b]Read Notes, Books & Guides[/b]: Read-only access to mentor notes, intel slips, book pages, and visible text on guide cards and wanted posters.
[*]⚙️ [b]Flexible API & Customizable Persona (F7)[/b]: Press [b]F7[/b] for settings. Supports any OpenAI-compatible endpoint (DeepSeek, OpenAI, or local models via Ollama/vLLM); includes thinking level configuration and editable system prompts.
[*]🌐 [b]Automatic Bilingual Support[/b]: Mod UI and prompts automatically switch with the game's Chinese/English locale.
[/list]

